## What is proven / inferred / not tested
proven: a foreign process resetting the host-wide file breaks the sec08 limiter tests on main (6/6),
        and cannot after the fix (6/6 pass, plus the behavioral regression test).
inferred: the log-317 local failure had this cause (a second pytest process on the host).
not tested: production behavior change - none intended; product code untouched
            (only tests/conftest.py and a new test file). No skip/xfail/deselect added.
Side effect: each test session leaves one empty-ish temp dir agos_pytest_state_* in $TMPDIR
             (runtime files, not project files; not cleaned to avoid any deletion logic).

